1
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:17,792
I think I'm quite ready
for another adventure.

2
00:00:49,917 --> 00:00:54,375
Farewell, my brave Hobbits.

3
00:00:56,875 --> 00:01:00,375
My work is now finished.

4
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:06,917
Here at last, on the shores of the sea,

5
00:01:07,833 --> 00:01:12,375
comes the end of our Fellowship.

6
00:01:14,375 --> 00:01:17,542
I will not say: do not weep,

7
00:01:17,667 --> 00:01:23,000
for not all tears are an evil.

8
00:01:38,750 --> 00:01:41,875
It is time, Frodo.

9
00:01:46,333 --> 00:01:48,667
What does he mean?

10
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,583
We set out to save the Shire, Sam.

11
00:01:55,417 --> 00:01:58,583
And it has been saved,

12
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:04,792
but not for me.

13
00:02:05,417 --> 00:02:08,167
You don't mean that.

14
00:02:09,167 --> 00:02:11,875
You can't leave.

15
00:02:19,667 --> 00:02:23,500
The last pages are for you, Sam.
